  "content": "<p>現在來自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L'Enders Cataclysm</a> 模組的 3D 物品將使用來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a> 模組的正確戰鬥風格</p><p>修改物品列表</p><ul>\n<li>焚化爐</li>\n<li>碎肉機</li>\n<li>詛咒之弓</li>\n<li>烈焰壁壘</li>\n<li>沙漠之怒</li>\n<li>雷射格林機槍</li>\n<li>消滅者</li>\n<li>靈魂渲染者</li>\n<li>獻祭者</li>\n<li>珊瑚長矛</li>\n<li>珊瑚斬馬刀</li>\n<li>凋零突襲肩扛武器</li>\n<li>虛空突襲肩扛武器</li>\n<li>古代長矛</li>\n</ul><p>以下是改動範例</p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1271932/description_cee45c9f-10e0-440d-bec7-ce7fd215ee97.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1271932/description_c3981413-09ca-44f2-ac12-31d9f2c4da23.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1271932/description_6d458e34-e394-4e95-be55-709f49325516.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1271932/description_00b5c5b6-6291-4bda-80b5-a26572e60a2d.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1271932/description_69f317a3-d79f-42ad-8936-b40615eeba10.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1271932/description_0ba6934f-4136-4192-813e-41cb76bf347e.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這些並非全部改動，你將在遊戲中體驗更多。祝遊戲愉快！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模組應能與 Epic Fight 版本 20.10.6 及 L'Enders Cataclysm 版本 2.66 正常運作</p>",
